$$
{\begin{array}{rl}\displaystyle y + {\displaystyle \frac{5}{6}} - {\displaystyle \frac{5}{6}} & \displaystyle  = {\displaystyle \frac{11}{6}} - {\displaystyle \frac{5}{6}} \\ \displaystyle y + ( {\displaystyle \frac{5}{6}} - {\displaystyle \frac{5}{6}} ) & \displaystyle  = {\displaystyle \frac{11}{6}} - {\displaystyle \frac{5}{6}} \\ \displaystyle y + 0 & \displaystyle  = {\displaystyle \frac{6}{6}} \\ \displaystyle y & \displaystyle  = \bbox[4pt,border:1px solid lightgray]{ {\displaystyle \frac{6}{6}}} .\end{array}}
